---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadCapture from '../components/LeadCapture.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | 瑞士私人銀行級財務配置工具" currentPath="/">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="text-center py-12 md:py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative z-10 px-6">
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
                    <span data-i18n="home-hero-title">SmartUtilBox - 您的跨維度資產配置管家</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                    <span data-i18n="home-hero-desc">我們秉持數據驅動與實測精神，為您打造抗通膨、高稅務效益的全球資產護城河。</span>
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#tools-grid" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
                        <span data-i18n="home-btn1">開始免費診斷</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/consulting" class="px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-slate-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:border-white transition-colors">
                        <span data-i18n="home-btn2">預約顧問諮詢</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Abstract background shapes -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden z-0">
                <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-slate-800 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl"></div>
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-1/2 bg-emerald-900/20 rounded-tl-full blur-3xl"></div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- Tools Grid (Scenario-driven) -->
        <section id="tools-grid" class="pt-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 text-center"><span data-i18n="home-features-title">核心服務與工具</span></h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <a href="/mortgage" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">🏦 <span data-i18n="home-f1-tag">房產套利</span></span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors"><span data-i18n="home-f1-title">多國房貸試算</span></h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow"><span data-i18n="home-f1-desc">精準計算各國房貸本息與寬限期，秒懂未來的現金流變化與套利空間。</span></p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            <span data-i18n="home-f1-btn">開始試算</span> <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <a href="/compound" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">📈 <span data-i18n="home-f2-tag">資產增長</span></span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"><span data-i18n="home-f2-title">複利滾存計算</span></h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow"><span data-i18n="home-f2-desc">掌握時間的力量，預測定期定額投資的長期指數型增長。</span></p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            <span data-i18n="home-f2-btn">計算未來</span> <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <a href="/blog" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">📚 <span data-i18n="home-f3-tag">知識文章</span></span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors"><span data-i18n="home-f3-title">理財專欄</span></h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow"><span data-i18n="home-f3-desc">深入探討通膨防禦、提早退休與實體另類資產的配置策略。</span></p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            <span data-i18n="home-f3-btn">閱讀更多</span> <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Featured Article Section -->
        <section class="mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl border border-slate-100 relative">
            <!-- Fetch content from cash-drag -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-slate-800 rounded-t-3xl"></div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 text-center border-b pb-6 border-slate-100"><span data-i18n="home-blog-title">深度觀點：科技高薪族的隱形陷阱</span></h2>
            <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-6">
                <p><span data-i18n="home-blog-p1">許多在竹科、內科工作的高薪工程師都有一個共同的財務盲點：他們在職場上積極進取，但在資金管理上卻極度保守。</span></p>
                <p><span data-i18n="home-blog-p2">當你打開網銀，看到活存帳戶裡躺著幾百萬，你可能覺得很有安全感。但在總體經濟的資本視角下，這是極度危險的配置。在金融界，這被稱為 <strong>"Cash Drag" (現金拖累)</strong>。</span></p>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900"><span data-i18n="home-blog-h1">什麼是 Cash Drag？</span></h3>
                <p><span data-i18n="home-blog-p3">假設你有 1,000 萬的總資產。你將 500 萬投入年化報酬率 8% 的優質美股，剩下的 500 萬放在只給 1% 活存的銀行裡。你可能覺得自己投資做得很不錯。但實際上，你整個資產組合的「加權平均報酬率」被那些現金嚴重稀釋，拖累到只剩下 4.5%。</span></p>
                <p><span data-i18n="home-blog-p4">在長期通膨率動輒 3% 到 4% 的時代，4.5% 的報酬率意味著你只是在「原地踏步」。這完全無法產生複利的爆發力，更別提幫你達到提早退休 (FIRE) 的目標。</span></p>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900"><span data-i18n="home-blog-h2">富人的資金處理方式</span></h3>
                <p><span data-i18n="home-blog-p5">頂級的財富管理，絕對不允許大筆資金閒置。除了保留 6 到 12 個月的緊急預備金之外，剩下的每一分錢都必須被推上戰場。如果你擔心股市估值過高，不敢將資金全數投入股市，<strong>實體另類資產 (如名酒、高級腕錶或藝術品)</strong> 是一個極佳的資金蓄水池。它們不隨華爾街的波動起舞，卻擁有絕對的稀缺性來對抗通膨。</span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 text-center">
                <a href="/blog/cash-drag" class="text-emerald-700 font-bold hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors"><span data-i18n="home-blog-btn">閱讀完整文章 &rarr;</span></a>
            </div>
        </section>
<!-- Lead Capture -->
        <LeadCapture />

    </div>
</BaseLayout>

