        'home-blog-title': 'Deep Dive: The Invisible Trap for High-Income Tech Workers',
        'home-blog-p1': 'Many high-income engineers working in tech hubs share a common financial blind spot: they are aggressive in their careers but extremely conservative in capital management.',
        'home-blog-p2': 'When you open your banking app and see millions sitting in your savings account, you might feel secure. But from a macroeconomic capital perspective, this is highly dangerous. In the financial world, this is known as <strong>"Cash Drag"</strong>.',
